      "leadSummary": "> **OpenSTEM Biological Sciences / Book 12: Plant Physiology.** This is an original **unreviewed undergraduate study manuscript**. All example values, comparison series and computational results are synthetic teaching illustrations, not published experimental observations, crop management advice or independently valida",
